From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Dago <ydago@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 09:31:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 09/48] [net][policy] Transition proxy support for
 AllHttpAuthSchemesAllowedForOrigins to M161

AllHttpAuthSchemesAllowedForOrigins previously bypassed AuthSchemes for
both servers and proxies because target was ignored. Proxy support for
this policy is deprecated and will be removed in M161.

This CL:
- Plumbs patterns_allowed_to_use_all_schemes_for_proxies through
  mojom::HttpAuthDynamicParams to NetworkContext.
- In SystemNetworkContextManager, copies origins patterns to proxy
  patterns when CHROME_VERSION_MAJOR < 161.
- Plumbs HttpAuth::Target through HttpAuthPreferences so NetworkContext
  evaluates proxy challenges using proxy_url_matcher_.
- Updates AllHttpAuthSchemesAllowedForOrigins.yaml documentation.

Bug: 533454968
